I go into the living room.
There is a small desk by the window.
The table is for my work.
I am a software engineer.
My workspace is important to me.
I open my bag.
I take my computer out.
It now sits on the table.
There is also a lamp on the table.
The lamp stands right by the computer.
It has a warm light.
There is also a small book lying on the table.
I have a small black bag with cables.
It lies under the desk.
That way, the bag is not in the way.
There is a good chair by the desk.
I sit in the chair and look.
My workspace is completely ready.
